---
// Decorative Hong Kong skyline behind the Home header, tinted with the theme's contour colour.
---

<div class="skyline" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .skyline {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: clamp(300px, calc(50vw - 300px), 640px);
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;
    background: var(--contour);
    -webkit-mask: url("/hk-skyline.png") no-repeat bottom right / contain;
    mask: url("/hk-skyline.png") no-repeat bottom right / contain;
    opacity: 0.13;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .skyline { width: 100%; opacity: 0.11; }
  }
</style>
